--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -25,10 +25,21 @@
 - Standalone-режим: репозиторий собирается и запускается без соседнего `services-base` (убраны extra `cli-platform`, uv source, Docker additional_context и CI checkout). Token-режим CLI без `sdlc-cli-core` выдаёт понятную ошибку; запуск без `AUTH_ISSUER` работает без авторизации.
 
 ### Fixed
+
+- Base 7e27713 supplies shared label/control typography through generated SSR
+  assets and the pinned React package; no hand-copied tokens or runtime rollout.
 - Agent create/update keeps drafts frozen after lost responses, 5xx and malformed
   or mismatched ACKs. Explicit no-cache catalogue readback reconciles the result
   without replay; confirmed 401/403/404 disables CRUD and retains the values.
   Validation/conflict errors remain editable. No API or runtime changes.
+- Workflow editor and instruction pages use Base SSR controls, inline states
+  and draft protection. Pending locks controls and direct handlers; uncertain
+  writes require read-only reconciliation without mutation replay. Rejections
+  retain raw values, terminal access/not-found states block CRUD, and reordered
+  instructions return focus to an enabled field when the trigger is disabled.
+  Workflow create mode survives direct open/reload and namespace compatibility
+  is retained. The unused external font import is removed; Base owns typography.
+  Source/browser fixtures do not constitute accepted-image/SSO release evidence.
 - Docker frontend stage includes the pinned `.base-revision` before recording
   product fingerprints; container metadata now attests the same runtime inputs
   as the clean checkout. Jinja/React routes and the active skills catalog are unchanged.
diff --git a/docs/UI_UX_MAP.md b/docs/UI_UX_MAP.md
index db26692..895ab42 100644
--- a/docs/UI_UX_MAP.md
+++ b/docs/UI_UX_MAP.md
@@ -50,6 +50,25 @@ runtime-build-manifest и ui-build. Совместимость со штатны
 
 ## Текущая Композиция Страниц
 
+Редактор workflows сохраняет Base `wide`: каталог и форма составляют одну
+рабочую композицию без дополнительной карточки вокруг формы. Прямой URL
+`workflow_mode=create` восстанавливает создание после reload; неизвестный mode
+и конфликт с явным workflow ID дают 422 без редактора. Dirty selection/history,
+cancel и navigation защищает Base draft guard. Каталог при ошибке refresh не
+перезаписывает форму и не открывает CRUD по устаревшей записи.
+
+`/instructions` остаётся `reading`. Поля description/skills, тип, создание и
+порядок имеют общий product-owned operation lock. ACK проверяет HTTP и DTO,
+unknown требует явной сверки существующим GET без повторения записи. Потерянный
+POST без authoritative ID не объявляется успешным по совпавшему неуникальному
+описанию. Известные ошибки сохраняют raw draft; 401/403/404 блокируют CRUD.
+DELETE сохраняет блокировку после cancel/reopen до readback. Удаление своей
+строки не сбрасывает другие drafts; focus возвращается к доступному control.
+
+Эти изменения проверяются на изолированной копии fixture БД. Они не закрывают
+phase detail/catalog backlog или actual-image/SSO/README release acceptance.
+Подробности: [план редакторов](plans/2026-10-06-workflow-editor-instructions.md).
+
 Base поставляет React primitives и SSR `page_header`/`state`; фактическая версия
 определяется build fingerprint, а не историческим SHA из описания композиции.
 Jinja показывает единственный `h1` в рабочей области; верхний header содержит
diff --git a/docs/plans/2026-10-06-workflow-editor-instructions.md b/docs/plans/2026-10-06-workflow-editor-instructions.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9dce219
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/plans/2026-10-06-workflow-editor-instructions.md
@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+# Workflow Editor И Инструкции
+
+## Границы
+
+Закрывает source findings WF-EDITOR-01/02/03 и WF-INSTRUCTION-01/02 из
+workspace backlog 2026-10-06. Jinja остаётся основным UI; API, schema, active
+catalog, auth и read-only React pilot не меняются. Phase detail и каталог фаз
+остаются отдельной очередью, а не считаются исправленными этим изменением.
+
+## Реализация
+
+- Основа объединённого кандидата: agent lifecycle `d8da8f8` и Base UI snapshot
+  `7e27713`. `.base-revision`, installed package/lock и детерминированный SSR
+  export должны подтверждать один источник; подписи 12 px, поля 14 px.
+- Base SSR fields/buttons/states и draft guard, без второго modal/token set.
+- Workflow editor без плавающей form card, с direct create URL/reload,
+  indexed history, безопасной сменой контекста и сохранённой шириной `wide`.
+- Product-owned pending/unknown/terminal lifecycle для связанных controls и
+  прямых handlers. ACK проверяет HTTP, положительный ID и значения DTO.
+- GET no-store reconciliation, без автоматического POST/PUT/DELETE replay.
+  Stale/malformed/transient ответы не разблокируют неподтверждённую запись.
+  Неуникальное имя/описание без authoritative create ID не доказывает ACK.
+- Ошибки сохраняют raw draft; 401/403/404 блокируют недоступный CRUD.
+- Instruction reorder не откатывает неизвестный server outcome. Подтверждённая
+  перестановка возвращает focus к textarea, если trigger стал disabled.
+- DELETE не снимает unknown lock после cancel/reopen; поддерживает только
+  original operation readback. Удаление не стирает drafts соседних строк.
+- Catalog refresh сохраняет форму; partial error не маскируется как empty.
+- Header, gutter и layout modes остаются Base. Controls 40/44 px; размеры текста
+  задаются Base. Неиспользуемый remote font import удалён, shell использует
+  существующий системный font stack без внешнего запроса.
+
+## Проверки
+
+Scoped browser v3: 84 passed (38 editor, 46 instructions), все три темы,
+desktop 1440/1920/2560, 375 и границы 767/768,1023/1024,1279/1280. Есть проверки
+geometry/overflow, длинных данных, pending duplicate calls, HTTP rejection,
+потерянных фактически сохранённых POST/PUT/DELETE/reorder, GET faults и focus.
+Stands используют disposable fixture copy, не accepted runtime.
+
+До интеграции обязательны свежие frontend/SSR/docs checks и полный объединённый
+Python/PostgreSQL/coverage/Ruff/mypy/warnings gate после интеграции agent lifecycle
+и выбранного Base snapshot. Full browser/native deletion regression выполняется
+на тех же неизменных исходниках. Scoped 84 tests не заменяют этот полный gate.
+
+После source integration остаются immutable image, SSO/roles/state matrix,
+README provenance и официальный product mirror sync. Accepted pins, snapshots,
+signing keys и volumes этим кандидатом не изменяются.
diff --git a/frontend/e2e/instruction-drafts.spec.ts b/frontend/e2e/instruction-drafts.spec.ts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..97bcafa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/frontend/e2e/instruction-drafts.spec.ts
@@ -0,0 +1,309 @@
+import { expect, test, type Page } from '@playwright/test'
+
+if (process.env.WORKFLOW_UI_QA_MUTATIONS !== 'isolated-fixture') throw new Error('Instruction QA requires an isolated fixture')
+
+let workflowId = 0
+let phaseId = 0
+let ids: number[] = []
+const row = (page: Page, index = 0) => page.locator(`#instructionsLayout [data-instruction-id="${ids[index]}"]`)
+const field = (page: Page, index = 0) => row(page, index).locator('.instruction-text')
+const state = (page: Page) => page.locator('#instructionWriteError [data-page-state]')
+const reconcile = (page: Page) => page.locator('#instructionReconcileButton')
+const open = (page: Page) => page.goto(`/instructions?phase_id=${phaseId}`)
+
+test.beforeEach(async ({ request }) => {
+  workflowId = 0; phaseId = 0; ids = []
+  const response = await request.post('/api/workflows', { data: { name: `Instruction fixture ${crypto.randomUUID()}`, description: 'Disposable browser QA' } })
+  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+  workflowId = (await response.json()).workflow_id as number
+  const phases = await request.get(`/api/phases?workflow_id=${workflowId}`)
+  expect(phases.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+  phaseId = (await phases.json()).phases[0].id as number
+  for (const description of ['First instruction', 'Second instruction']) {
+    const created = await request.post('/api/instructions', { data: { phase_id: phaseId, description } })
+    expect(created.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    ids.push((await created.json()).instruction.id as number)
+  }
+})
+
+test.afterEach(async ({ request }) => {
+  if (workflowId > 0) expect((await request.delete(`/api/workflows/${workflowId}`)).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+})
+
+for (const theme of ['dark', 'gray', 'light']) {
+  test(`instruction delete Escape restores the initiator after the operation unlocks (${theme})`, async ({ page, request }) => {
+    await page.addInitScript(value => localStorage.setItem('workflow-theme', value), theme)
+    await open(page)
+    const trigger = row(page).locator('button[onclick="deleteInstruction(this)"]')
+    await trigger.click()
+    await expect(page.locator('#confirmDialog')).toBeVisible()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(page.locator('#confirmDialog')).not.toBeVisible()
+    await expect(trigger).toBeEnabled()
+    await expect(trigger).toBeFocused()
+    const response = await request.get(`/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions`)
+    expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    expect((await response.json()).instructions.some((item: { id: number }) => item.id === ids[0])).toBeTruthy()
+  })
+
+  test(`instruction editor Base reading geometry, long text and keyboard (${theme})`, async ({ page, request }, testInfo) => {
+    await page.addInitScript(value => localStorage.setItem('workflow-theme', value), theme)
+    expect((await request.put(`/api/instructions/${ids[0]}`, { data: { description: 'Длинная инструкция '.repeat(35), skills: ['ОченьДлинноеНазваниеНавыка'.repeat(8)] } })).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    const widths = testInfo.project.name === 'desktop' ? [1023, 1024, 1279, 1280, 1440, 1920, 2560] : [375, 767, 768]
+    for (const width of widths) {
+      await page.setViewportSize({ width, height: 1080 })
+      await open(page)
+      await page.reload()
+      await expect(page.locator('[data-page-layout]')).toHaveAttribute('data-page-layout', 'reading')
+      const geometry = await page.locator('[data-page-layout]').boundingBox()
+      const sidebar = width >= 1280 ? 264 : width >= 768 ? 72 : 0
+      const gutter = Math.min(32, Math.max(16, width * 0.02))
+      expect(geometry!.x).toBeCloseTo(sidebar + gutter, 1)
+      expect(geometry!.width).toBeCloseTo(Math.min(760, width - sidebar - gutter * 2), 1)
+      expect(await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.scrollWidth - innerWidth)).toBe(0)
+      for (const control of [field(page), row(page).locator('.skills-input'), row(page).locator('.type-badge'), row(page).locator('.move-up'), row(page).locator('.row-actions button'), page.locator('#newInstructionText'), page.locator('#addInstructionButton')]) {
+        const bounds = (await control.boundingBox())!
+        expect(bounds.height).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(width < 768 ? 44 : 40)
+        expect(bounds.x).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(geometry!.x - 0.1)
+        expect(bounds.x + bounds.width).toBeLessThanOrEqual(geometry!.x + geometry!.width + 0.1)
+      }
+      for (const control of [field(page), row(page).locator('.skills-input'), row(page).locator('.type-badge'), page.locator('#newInstructionText')]) {
+        expect(await control.evaluate(node => getComputedStyle(node).fontSize)).toBe('14px')
+      }
+      if (width === 1920 || width === 375) await page.screenshot({ path: testInfo.outputPath(`instruction-editor-${theme}-${width}.png`), fullPage: true })
+    }
+    await page.locator('#newInstructionText').fill('Unsaved new instruction')
+    if (page.viewportSize()!.width < 768) await page.locator('#burgerBtn').click()
+    await page.locator('.sidebar-link:visible[href^="/tasks"]').first().click()
+    await expect(page.locator('[data-base-draft-dialog]')).toBeVisible()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('Unsaved new instruction')
+  })
+}
+
+for (const status of [401, 403, 404, 409, 422]) {
+  test(`instruction editor HTTP ${status} preserves raw description and classifies rejection`, async ({ page }) => {
+    await open(page)
+    await page.route(`**/api/instructions/${ids[0]}*`, route => route.fulfill({ status, json: { ok: true, error: `Rejected ${status}` } }))
+    await field(page).fill('  Rejected raw draft  ')
+    await field(page).dispatchEvent('change')
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(`Rejected ${status}`)
+    await expect(field(page)).toHaveValue('  Rejected raw draft  ')
+    if ([401, 403, 404].includes(status)) {
+      await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('data-page-state', status === 404 ? 'not-found' : 'permission-denied')
+      await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('role', 'status')
+      await expect(state(page)).toBeFocused()
+      await expect(field(page)).toBeDisabled()
+      await expect(page.locator('#addInstructionButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    } else {
+      await expect(field(page)).toBeEnabled()
+      await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('role', 'alert')
+      await expect(state(page)).toBeFocused()
+    }
+    await expect(reconcile(page)).not.toBeVisible()
+    await expect(page.locator('#toast')).not.toHaveText(`Rejected ${status}`)
+  })
+}
+
+test('instruction editor whitespace validation retains draft and never writes', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  let writes = 0
+  page.on('request', request => { if (request.method() !== 'GET' && new URL(request.url()).pathname.startsWith('/api/')) writes++ })
+  await field(page).fill('   ')
+  await field(page).dispatchEvent('change')
+  await expect(field(page)).toHaveValue('   ')
+  await expect(field(page)).toBeFocused()
+  await expect(field(page)).toHaveAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true')
+  expect(writes).toBe(0)
+})
+
+test('instruction editor pending description locks all handlers and fields until known rejection', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  let writes = 0
+  let release!: () => void
+  const held = new Promise<void>(resolve => { release = resolve })
+  await page.route(`**/api/instructions/${ids[0]}*`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    await held
+    await route.fulfill({ status: 422, json: { ok: false, error: 'Fixture rejected' } })
+  })
+  try {
+    await field(page).fill('Pending description')
+    await field(page).dispatchEvent('change')
+    await expect(page.locator('#instructionsLayout')).toHaveAttribute('aria-busy', 'true')
+    await expect(field(page, 1)).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#addInstructionButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    await page.evaluate(async id => {
+      const ui = window as unknown as { updateInstruction: (field: Element) => Promise<void>; toggleType: (field: Element) => Promise<void>; moveInstruction: (field: Element, direction: number) => Promise<void>; addInstruction: () => Promise<void> }
+      const row = document.querySelector(`[data-instruction-id="${id}"]`)!
+      await ui.updateInstruction(row.querySelector('.instruction-text')!)
+      await ui.toggleType(row.querySelector('.type-badge')!)
+      await ui.moveInstruction(row.querySelector('.move-up')!, -1)
+      await ui.addInstruction()
+    }, ids[0])
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+    release()
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveText('Fixture rejected')
+    await expect(field(page)).toBeEnabled()
+    await expect(field(page)).toHaveValue('Pending description')
+  } finally { release() }
+})
+
+for (const property of ['description', 'skills', 'execution_type']) {
+  test(`instruction editor lost ${property} PUT reconciles by GET and preserves another draft`, async ({ page, request }) => {
+    await open(page)
+    await page.locator('#newInstructionText').fill('Unrelated create draft')
+    let writes = 0
+    await page.route(`**/api/instructions/${ids[0]}*`, async route => {
+      writes++
+      expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+      await route.abort('failed')
+    })
+    if (property === 'description') { await field(page).fill('Persisted description'); await field(page).dispatchEvent('change') }
+    else if (property === 'skills') { await row(page).locator('.skills-input').fill('workflow, review'); await row(page).locator('.skills-input').dispatchEvent('change') }
+    else await row(page).locator('.type-badge').click()
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/Результат записи неизвестен/)
+    await expect(reconcile(page)).toBeFocused()
+    await expect(field(page)).toBeDisabled()
+    await reconcile(page).click()
+    await expect(page.locator('#instructionWriteError')).not.toBeVisible()
+    await expect(field(page)).toBeEnabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('Unrelated create draft')
+    const records = (await (await request.get(`/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions`)).json()).instructions as { id: number; description: string; skills: string[]; execution_type: string }[]
+    const record = records.find(item => item.id === ids[0])!
+    if (property === 'description') expect(record.description).toBe('Persisted description')
+    else if (property === 'skills') expect(record.skills).toEqual(['workflow', 'review'])
+    else expect(record.execution_type).toBe('parallel')
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  })
+}
+
+test('instruction editor lost POST without ID never acknowledges a nonunique matching description', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#newInstructionText').fill('Nonunique instruction create')
+  let writes = 0
+  await page.route('**/api/instructions?*', async route => {
+    writes++
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await page.route('**/api/instructions', async route => {
+    writes++
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await page.locator('#addInstructionButton').click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/Результат записи неизвестен/)
+  await reconcile(page).click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/не подтверждено/)
+  await expect(page.locator('#instructionReadbackCandidates a')).toHaveCount(1)
+  await expect(page.locator('#instructionReadbackCandidates a')).toHaveAttribute('target', '_blank')
+  await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('Nonunique instruction create')
+  await expect(page.locator('#addInstructionButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
+
+test('instruction editor lost reorder preserves planned order and verifies actual server order', async ({ page, request }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  let writes = 0
+  let order: number[] = []
+  await page.route(`**/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions/reorder*`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    order = route.request().postDataJSON().instruction_ids as number[]
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await row(page, 1).locator('.move-up').click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/Результат записи неизвестен/)
+  expect(await page.locator('#instructionsLayout .instruction-row').evaluateAll(rows => rows.map(row => Number((row as HTMLElement).dataset.instructionId)))).toEqual(order)
+  await reconcile(page).click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#instructionWriteError')).not.toBeVisible()
+  await expect(row(page, 1).locator('.move-up')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(field(page, 1)).toBeFocused()
+  const records = (await (await request.get(`/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions`)).json()).instructions as { id: number }[]
+  expect(records.map(item => item.id)).toEqual(order)
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
+
+test('instruction editor acknowledged create appends without dropping unrelated draft or reloading', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  await field(page, 1).fill('Unrelated raw draft')
+  await page.locator('#newInstructionText').evaluate(node => { (node as HTMLInputElement).value = 'Acknowledged create' })
+  const url = page.url()
+  await page.evaluate(async () => { await (window as unknown as { addInstruction: () => Promise<void> }).addInstruction() })
+  expect(await page.locator('#instructionsLayout .instruction-text').evaluateAll(fields => fields.map(field => (field as HTMLTextAreaElement).value))).toContain('Acknowledged create')
+  await expect(field(page, 1)).toHaveValue('Unrelated raw draft')
+  expect(page.url()).toBe(url)
+  await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('')
+})
+
+for (const fault of ['stale', 'malformed', 'transient', 'missing', '403', '404']) {
+  test(`instruction editor unknown PUT readback ${fault} never unlocks unconfirmed writes`, async ({ page }) => {
+    await open(page)
+    let writes = 0
+    await page.route(`**/api/instructions/${ids[0]}*`, async route => {
+      writes++
+      expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+      await route.abort('failed')
+    })
+    await field(page).fill('Persisted but uncertain draft')
+    await field(page).dispatchEvent('change')
+    await expect(reconcile(page)).toBeVisible()
+    await page.route(`**/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions*`, async route => {
+      if (['transient', '403', '404'].includes(fault)) {
+        await route.fulfill({ status: fault === 'transient' ? 503 : Number(fault), json: { ok: true, instructions: [] } })
+        return
+      }
+      const response = await route.fetch()
+      const data = await response.json() as { phase: { id: number }; instructions: { id: number; description: string; step_num: number }[] }
+      if (fault === 'stale') data.instructions.find(item => item.id === ids[0])!.description = 'Old stale description'
+      else if (fault === 'malformed') data.phase.id = phaseId + 100000
+      else data.instructions = data.instructions.filter(item => item.id !== ids[0]).map((item, index) => ({ ...item, step_num: index + 1 }))
+      await route.fulfill({ response, json: data })
+    })
+    await reconcile(page).click()
+    await expect(field(page)).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(field(page)).toHaveValue('Persisted but uncertain draft')
+    await expect(page.locator('#addInstructionButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    if (['missing', '403', '404'].includes(fault)) {
+      await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('data-page-state', fault === '403' ? 'permission-denied' : 'not-found')
+      await expect(state(page)).toBeFocused()
+      await expect(reconcile(page)).not.toBeVisible()
+    } else {
+      await expect(reconcile(page)).toBeEnabled()
+      await page.unroute(`**/api/phases/${phaseId}/instructions*`)
+      await reconcile(page).click()
+      await expect(field(page)).toBeEnabled()
+      await expect(page.locator('#instructionWriteError')).not.toBeVisible()
+    }
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  })
+}
+
+test('instruction editor lost DELETE keeps other drafts and locks writes across cancel/reopen', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#newInstructionText').fill('Unrelated deletion draft')
+  let writes = 0
+  await page.route(`**/api/instructions/${ids[0]}*`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    expect(route.request().method()).toBe('DELETE')
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await row(page).locator('.row-actions button').click()
+  await page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#confirmReconcile')).toBeVisible()
+  await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+  await expect(field(page, 1)).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('Unrelated deletion draft')
+  await expect(page.locator('#addInstructionButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  await row(page).locator('.row-actions button').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]')).toBeDisabled()
+  await page.locator('#confirmReconcile').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#confirmDialog')).not.toBeVisible()
+  await expect(row(page)).toHaveCount(0)
+  await expect(field(page, 1)).toBeEnabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#newInstructionText')).toHaveValue('Unrelated deletion draft')
+  await expect(page.locator('main')).toBeFocused()
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
diff --git a/frontend/e2e/workflow-editor.spec.ts b/frontend/e2e/workflow-editor.spec.ts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..17b0c6e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/frontend/e2e/workflow-editor.spec.ts
@@ -0,0 +1,347 @@
+import { expect, test, type Page } from '@playwright/test'
+
+if (process.env.WORKFLOW_UI_QA_MUTATIONS !== 'isolated-fixture') {
+  throw new Error('Workflow editor QA requires an isolated fixture')
+}
+
+let ids: number[] = []
+const dialog = (page: Page) => page.locator('[data-base-draft-dialog]')
+const state = (page: Page) => page.locator('#workflowWriteError [data-page-state]')
+
+test.beforeEach(async ({ request }) => {
+  ids = []
+  for (const name of ['First', 'Second']) {
+    const response = await request.post('/api/workflows', { data: { name: `${name} editor ${crypto.randomUUID()}`, description: `${name} original description` } })
+    expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    ids.push((await response.json()).workflow_id as number)
+  }
+})
+
+test.afterEach(async ({ request }) => {
+  for (const id of ids) {
+    const response = await request.delete(`/api/workflows/${id}`)
+    if (response.status() === 404) {
+      const rows = (await (await request.get('/api/workflows')).json()).workflows as { id: number }[]
+      expect(rows.some(item => item.id === id)).toBeFalsy()
+    } else expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+  }
+})
+
+async function open(page: Page) {
+  await page.goto(`/workflows?workflow_id=${ids[0]}&namespace_id=1&foreign=keep#workflowForm`)
+}
+
+async function select(page: Page, id: number) {
+  if (page.viewportSize()!.width < 980) await page.locator('#workflowSelect').selectOption(String(id))
+  else await page.locator(`#workflowNav [data-workflow-id="${id}"]`).click()
+}
+
+for (const theme of ['dark', 'gray', 'light']) {
+  test(`workflow editor Base geometry, long data and direct create/reload (${theme})`, async ({ page, request }, testInfo) => {
+    const widths = testInfo.project.name === 'desktop' ? [1023, 1024, 1279, 1280, 1440, 1920, 2560] : [375, 767, 768]
+    const name = `Длинное название ${'воркфлоу'.repeat(18)} ${crypto.randomUUID()}`
+    expect((await request.put(`/api/workflows/${ids[0]}`, { data: { name, description: 'Длинное описание '.repeat(30) } })).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await page.addInitScript(value => localStorage.setItem('workflow-theme', value), theme)
+    const pageErrors: string[] = []
+    page.on('pageerror', error => pageErrors.push(error.message))
+    for (const width of widths) {
+      await page.setViewportSize({ width, height: 1080 })
+      for (const create of [false, true]) {
+        await page.goto(create ? '/workflows?workflow_mode=create&namespace_id=1&foreign=keep' : `/workflows?workflow_id=${ids[0]}&namespace_id=1&foreign=keep`)
+        await page.reload()
+        await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toHaveValue(create ? '' : name)
+        await expect(page.locator('[data-page-layout]')).toHaveAttribute('data-page-layout', 'wide')
+        const geometry = await page.evaluate(() => {
+          const header = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.base-ssr-header')!
+          const frame = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.page-frame')!
+          const stack = frame.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.base-page-stack')!
+          const sidebar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.base-shell-sidebar')!
+          const form = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#workflowForm')!
+          return {
+            overflow: document.documentElement.scrollWidth - innerWidth,
+            headerHeight: header.getBoundingClientRect().height,
+            sidebarWidth: sidebar.getBoundingClientRect().width,
+            frame: { left: frame.getBoundingClientRect().left, right: frame.getBoundingClientRect().right },
+            stack: { left: stack.getBoundingClientRect().left, right: stack.getBoundingClientRect().right },
+            form: { left: form.getBoundingClientRect().left, right: form.getBoundingClientRect().right, top: form.getBoundingClientRect().top },
+            titleBottom: document.querySelector('.base-page-header')!.getBoundingClientRect().bottom,
+            fontSize: getComputedStyle(document.querySelector('#workflowName')!).fontSize,
+          }
+        })
+        const sidebarWidth = width >= 1280 ? 264 : width >= 768 ? 72 : 0
+        const gutter = Math.min(32, Math.max(16, width * 0.02))
+        expect(geometry.overflow, `${theme}/${width}/${create}`).toBe(0)
+        expect(geometry.headerHeight).toBe(60)
+        expect(geometry.sidebarWidth).toBe(sidebarWidth)
+        expect(geometry.frame.left).toBe(sidebarWidth)
+        expect(geometry.frame.right).toBe(width)
+        expect(geometry.stack.left).toBeCloseTo(sidebarWidth + gutter, 1)
+        expect(geometry.stack.right).toBeCloseTo(width - gutter, 1)
+        expect(geometry.form.left).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(geometry.stack.left)
+        expect(geometry.form.right).toBeLessThanOrEqual(geometry.stack.right + 0.1)
+        expect(geometry.form.top).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(geometry.titleBottom + 19)
+        expect(geometry.fontSize).toBe('14px')
+        for (const selector of ['#workflowName', '#workflowDescription', '#workflowSubmitButton', '#newWorkflowButton', '#workflowSelect']) {
+          const box = await page.locator(selector).boundingBox()
+          if (box) {
+            expect(box.height, `${selector}/${width}`).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(width < 768 ? 44 : 40)
+            expect(box.x).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(geometry.stack.left - 0.1)
+            expect(box.x + box.width).toBeLessThanOrEqual(geometry.stack.right + 0.1)
+          }
+        }
+        if (!create && (width === 1920 || width === 375)) {
+          await page.screenshot({ path: testInfo.outputPath(`workflow-editor-long-${theme}-${width}.png`), fullPage: true })
+        }
+      }
+    }
+    expect(pageErrors).toEqual([])
+  })
+
+  test(`workflow editor preserves dirty selection, create/cancel and Base targets (${theme})`, async ({ page }) => {
+    await page.addInitScript(value => localStorage.setItem('workflow-theme', value), theme)
+    await open(page)
+    const original = page.url()
+    const input = page.locator('#workflowName')
+    await input.fill('Unsaved workflow draft')
+    await select(page, ids[1])
+    await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(input).toHaveValue('Unsaved workflow draft')
+    expect(page.url()).toBe(original)
+    await page.locator('#newWorkflowButton').click()
+    await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(input).toHaveValue('Unsaved workflow draft')
+    await page.locator('#newWorkflowButton').click()
+    await page.locator('[data-base-draft-discard]').click()
+    await expect(input).toHaveValue('')
+    expect(new URL(page.url()).searchParams.get('workflow_mode')).toBe('create')
+    expect(new URL(page.url()).searchParams.get('foreign')).toBe('keep')
+    expect(new URL(page.url()).hash).toBe('#workflowForm')
+    await input.fill('Unsaved create draft')
+    await page.locator('#cancelCreateWorkflowButton').click()
+    await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(input).toHaveValue('Unsaved create draft')
+    for (const control of [input, page.locator('#workflowDescription'), page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')]) {
+      expect((await control.boundingBox())!.height).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(page.viewportSize()!.width < 768 ? 44 : 40)
+    }
+    expect(await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.scrollWidth - innerWidth)).toBe(0)
+    await page.screenshot({ path: test.info().outputPath(`workflow-editor-${theme}-${page.viewportSize()!.width}.png`), fullPage: true })
+  })
+}
+
+test('workflow editor indexed Back cancellation, discard and Forward preserve URL context', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  await select(page, ids[1])
+  await expect(page).toHaveURL(new RegExp(`workflow_id=${ids[1]}`))
+  const accepted = page.url()
+  await page.locator('#workflowName').fill('Second workflow draft')
+  await page.goBack()
+  await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+  await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toHaveValue('Second workflow draft')
+  expect(page.url()).toBe(accepted)
+  await page.goBack()
+  await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+  await page.locator('[data-base-draft-discard]').click()
+  await expect(page).toHaveURL(new RegExp(`workflow_id=${ids[0]}`))
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toHaveValue('First original description')
+  await page.goForward()
+  await expect(page).toHaveURL(new RegExp(`workflow_id=${ids[1]}`))
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toHaveValue('Second original description')
+  expect(new URL(page.url()).searchParams.get('foreign')).toBe('keep')
+  expect(new URL(page.url()).hash).toBe('#workflowForm')
+})
+
+test('workflow editor pending write blocks fields, direct duplicate handlers and departure', async ({ page }) => {
+  let writes = 0
+  let release!: () => void
+  const held = new Promise<void>(resolve => { release = resolve })
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#workflowName').fill('Pending workflow draft')
+  await page.route(`**/api/workflows/${ids[0]}`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    await held
+    await route.fulfill({ status: 422, json: { ok: false, error: 'Fixture rejected' } })
+  })
+  try {
+    await page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton').click()
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowForm')).toHaveAttribute('aria-busy', 'true')
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#newWorkflowButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    await page.evaluate(() => {
+      const ui = window as unknown as { submitWorkflow: () => Promise<void>; saveWorkflow: () => Promise<void>; createWorkflow: () => Promise<void> }
+      void ui.submitWorkflow()
+      void ui.saveWorkflow()
+      void ui.createWorkflow()
+    })
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+    if (page.viewportSize()!.width < 768) await page.locator('#burgerBtn').click()
+    await page.locator('.sidebar-link:visible[href^="/tasks"]').first().click()
+    await expect(dialog(page)).toBeVisible()
+    await expect(page.locator('[data-base-draft-discard]')).toBeDisabled()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    release()
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowForm')).toHaveAttribute('aria-busy', 'false')
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveText('Fixture rejected')
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeEnabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toHaveValue('Pending workflow draft')
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  } finally { release() }
+})
+
+for (const status of [403, 404, 409, 422]) {
+  test(`workflow editor HTTP ${status} preserves draft and distinguishes terminal rejection`, async ({ page }) => {
+    await open(page)
+    await page.locator('#workflowDescription').fill('Rejected description')
+    await page.route(`**/api/workflows/${ids[0]}`, route => route.fulfill({ status, json: { ok: true, error: `Rejection ${status}` } }))
+    await page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton').click()
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(`Rejection ${status}`)
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toHaveValue('Rejected description')
+    if (status === 403 || status === 404) {
+      await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('data-page-state', status === 403 ? 'permission-denied' : 'not-found')
+      await expect(state(page)).toBeFocused()
+      await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    } else await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeEnabled()
+  })
+}
+
+test('workflow editor lost PUT acknowledgement reconciles only by GET without replay', async ({ page, request }) => {
+  let writes = 0
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#workflowDescription').fill('Persisted description')
+  await page.route(`**/api/workflows/${ids[0]}`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    expect(route.request().method()).toBe('PUT')
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton').click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/Результат записи неизвестен/)
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowReconcileButton')).toBeFocused()
+  await page.evaluate(async () => {
+    await (window as unknown as { submitWorkflow: () => Promise<void> }).submitWorkflow()
+  })
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  await page.locator('#workflowReconcileButton').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowWriteError')).not.toBeVisible()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toBeEnabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowDescription')).toHaveValue('Persisted description')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeFocused()
+  const rows = (await (await request.get('/api/workflows')).json()).workflows as { id: number; description: string }[]
+  expect(rows.find(item => item.id === ids[0])!.description).toBe('Persisted description')
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
+
+test('workflow editor lost POST response never treats matching nonunique names as acknowledged create', async ({ page }) => {
+  let writes = 0
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#newWorkflowButton').click()
+  await page.locator('#workflowName').fill('Nonunique workflow create')
+  await page.route('**/api/workflows', async route => {
+    if (route.request().method() === 'GET') { await route.continue(); return }
+    writes++
+    const response = await route.fetch()
+    expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    ids.push((await response.json()).workflow_id as number)
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton').click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/Результат записи неизвестен/)
+  await page.locator('#workflowReconcileButton').click()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveText(/результат записи не подтверждён/)
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowReadbackCandidates a')).toHaveCount(1)
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowReadbackCandidates a')).toHaveAttribute('target', '_blank')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toHaveValue('Nonunique workflow create')
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
+
+test('workflow editor confirmed create opens phases without an incompatible namespace query', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  await page.locator('#newWorkflowButton').click()
+  await page.locator('#workflowName').fill(`Acknowledged workflow ${crypto.randomUUID()}`)
+  await page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton').click()
+  await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\/phases\?workflow_id=\d+$/)
+  ids.push(Number(new URL(page.url()).searchParams.get('workflow_id')))
+  expect(new URL(page.url()).searchParams.has('namespace_id')).toBeFalsy()
+  await expect(page.locator('[data-page-layout]')).toHaveAttribute('data-page-layout', 'wide')
+})
+
+test('workflow editor unknown DELETE keeps all writes locked after cancellation and permits only readback', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  const deletedId = ids[0]
+  let writes = 0
+  await page.route(`**/api/workflows/${deletedId}`, async route => {
+    writes++
+    expect(route.request().method()).toBe('DELETE')
+    expect((await route.fetch()).ok()).toBeTruthy()
+    await route.abort('failed')
+  })
+  await page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton').click()
+  await page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('[data-base-confirm-error]')).toHaveText(/Результат удаления неизвестен/)
+  await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton')).toHaveText('Проверить удаление')
+  await page.evaluate(async () => {
+    const ui = window as unknown as { saveWorkflow: () => Promise<void>; createWorkflow: () => Promise<void> }
+    await ui.saveWorkflow()
+    await ui.createWorkflow()
+  })
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  await page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]')).toBeDisabled()
+  await page.locator('#confirmReconcile').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#confirmDialog')).not.toBeVisible()
+  await expect(page.locator(`#workflowNav [data-workflow-id="${deletedId}"]`)).toHaveCount(0)
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeEnabled()
+  expect(writes).toBe(1)
+})
+
+test('workflow editor acknowledged DELETE and failed catalogue refresh never expose stale CRUD', async ({ page }) => {
+  await open(page)
+  const deletedId = ids[0]
+  await page.route('**/api/workflows', route => route.fulfill({ status: 503, json: { ok: false } }))
+  await page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton').click()
+  await page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#confirmDialog')).not.toBeVisible()
+  await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('data-page-state', 'partial-error')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toHaveValue('')
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#newWorkflowButton')).toBeDisabled()
+  await expect(page.locator(`#workflowNav [data-workflow-id="${deletedId}"]`)).toHaveCount(0)
+  await page.unroute('**/api/workflows')
+  await page.locator('#workflowRefreshButton').click()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeEnabled()
+  await expect(page.locator('#workflowWriteError')).not.toBeVisible()
+})
+
+for (const status of [403, 404]) {
+  test(`workflow editor unknown DELETE readback HTTP ${status} disables inaccessible recovery`, async ({ page }) => {
+    await open(page)
+    let writes = 0
+    await page.route(`**/api/workflows/${ids[0]}`, async route => {
+      writes++
+      await route.abort('failed')
+    })
+    await page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton').click()
+    await page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]').click()
+    await expect(page.locator('#confirmReconcile')).toBeVisible()
+    await page.route('**/api/workflows', route => route.fulfill({ status, json: { ok: true, workflows: [] } }))
+    await page.locator('#confirmReconcile').click()
+    await expect(page.locator('#confirmReconcile')).not.toBeVisible()
+    await expect(page.locator('[data-base-confirm-accept]')).toBeDisabled()
+    await page.keyboard.press('Escape')
+    await expect(state(page)).toHaveAttribute('data-page-state', status === 404 ? 'not-found' : 'permission-denied')
+    await expect(state(page)).toBeFocused()
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowName')).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#workflowSubmitButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#deleteWorkflowButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    await expect(page.locator('#newWorkflowButton')).toBeDisabled()
+    expect(writes).toBe(1)
+  })
+}
